<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ukud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ukudomboketsa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha ukudomboketsa</para>
  <para style="mt1">UKUDOMBOKETSA</para>
  <para style="is">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Ukudomboketsa tsa chitabu chandikighwe kwa mashaili, nacho cholonga apfila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu pfaghuhinyighwe. Imunu iyandikike ichitabu cha ukudomboketsa ng'etambula mwenyegho baye, lekeni iwandishi wangi wa Chiyahudi na awala wa Chikilistu wotoghola ghendo ka nabii Yeremia yuyo iyachandike kwaapfila ichitabu chenyegho cholonga apfila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu pfaghuhinyighwe nacho chodaha kwandikighwa ng'ana ghupfike mwaka 586, ahala Kiristu ng'ana yoneke baye, lekeni ahala ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu haghuhinyighwe, lekeni chandikighwa ng'ana ghumwaka ghwa 516 ghupfike baye ahala ghumji haghutsengighwe keli na ing'anda ya IMNDEWA hailapfighwe kwa Imulungu. Ichitabu chandikighwa na munu yumwe iyakalile mna imiyaka ya ukuhinyighwa kwa ghumji ghwa Yelusalemu, mna ghumwaka ghwa 586 ng'ana Kiristu yoneke baye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chose cha Ukudomboketsa cholonga apfila iwanu wa Yerusalemu pfawakalile na usungu. Hata ka ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu tsaghuhinyighwa na maaduwi iwalawile Babeli, imunu iyandike ichitabu kandika ka ghumji agho ghuhinyighwa kwaapfila Imulungu yang'ali yowahigha iwanu wa isi ya Yuda. 1.12. Imulungu kaitowa isi ya Yuda kubitila maaduwi iwalawile Babeli iwatsile kuitsingila na kuitowa isi yawo. Imunu iyandikike ichitabu cha ukudomboketsa yang'ali yokumbuka apfila Imulungu pfayali wa ukutogholeka kwaapila aku kana usungu kalonga, “IMNDEWA kana libatsi na uluso wake mkulu ng'aumalagha baye.” 3.22 Kuya iyandike ichitabu achino komalitsila kwa ukumlomba Imulungu yawoyitse iwanu wa Yuda kuna yeye.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Imunu iyandike kolonga usungu wa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ahala Imulungu hayaghuhinyile na kuwahigha iwanu wake Isula ya 1.2</para>
  <para style="io">2. Imunu iyandike kokumbuka uluso mkulu wa Imulungu na kolomba yapfilighwe Isula ya 3</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Tsosimulila keli usungu ahala iwanu wa Yuda pfawapatile ghamaghayo Isula ya 4.5.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Imunu iyandike ichitabu komlomba Imulungu yawoyitse iwanu wa Yuda kuna yeye Isula ya 5</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Usungu kwa iwanu wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Lola ghumji aghuno ighumemile iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">lekeni sambi ghwahela wanu ghendo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Tsaghukala mji mkulu mna tsiisi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">lekeni sambi ghuwa ka pinga chitsuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Mna tsiisi tsingi tsaghwoneka ka neghe wa mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">lekeni sambi ghuwa mtumwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Ghwolila chilo chose kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">masotsi pukupuku mwikanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">ghumji agho tsaghunoghelwa na sale wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">lekeni kuduhu hata yumwe iyaghukanzile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">sale tsake wose wambugha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">na sambi womhila.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />Iwanu wa Yuda waghalighwa kuna isi ya utumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">aku woghaya na wawatumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">wokala kuna iwanu wa isi tsingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">ako wahela hanu ha ukubwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">maaduwi tsawo iwawawinzilitse wawaghogha aku woghanzika.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Tsinzila tsighenda kuna ichidunda Sayuni tsolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">kwaapfila kuduhu munu iyobita iyoghenda kuna ichihungo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Hana ghamalango ghake gha ukwitinganila kuduhu wanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">iwatambika wake woghutilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">iwali wake wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">na ghumji ghwenyegho ghwamna usungu mkulu.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />Yerusalemu ghotawalighwa na maaduwi tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">na awala iwaghudununze sambi wobweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">IMNDEWA kaghutenda ghumji agho ghughaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">kwaapfila iwanu wake watenda nzambi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">maaduwi wawaghogha iwana wa ghumji agho na wawaghala kuna utumwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Ukunogha kose kwa ghumji ghwa Sayuni kumala ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">iwakulu wake wawa ka dondolo yana inzala iyalihela mitsani ya ukuja,.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">maaduwi wowawinga nawo wotsuma pfipfo aku wanyonde nyonde.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Hawang'ali woghaya na ukwanga kwanga mna ghamatsuwa agho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">wakumbuka ghumji ghwao pfaghukalile ghunogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">na pfinu pfake pfinoghile ipfilkalile mumo mna ghamatsuwa gha ghumwande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Wokumbuka iwanu hawaghoghighwe na maaduwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">aku haduhu munu wa ukuwapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">na apfila maaduwi hawawalolile na kuwaseka hawang'ali woghaya.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Iwanu wa Yerusalemu watenda nzambi ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">apfo ghumji ghwao ghwiha ghendo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Iwanu wose iwaghuhulikitse aho ghumwande sambi woghubetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">kwaapfila waghona pfaghukalile chidako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Iwanu wake woghutilila na wopfisa ipfihanga pfawo kwaapfila wakwona chinyala.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Ichikwe chake chinanahila mna ghamagwanda ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">ng'alangule baye matsuwa ghake gha hambele chitsolawila choni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Apfo ukughwa kwa ghumji agho kukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">na tsakuduhu munu wa ukuwakanza iwanu wake, nawo wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">ghwe IMNDEWA, ulole apfila pfatughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">kwaapfila maaduwi tsetu watuhuma.<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />Maaduwi waboka pfinu pfake pfose ipfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">naye kowona iwanu iwali si Wayahudi baye, wakwingila hanu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">iwanu awala wauwaghomile ghweghwe waleke ukwingila hana ghumitingano ghwako.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />Iwanu wake wose woghutilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">hawohemela ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">wolapfa pfinu pfao waghule ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">ili waghendelele kukala wagima, nawo wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">“Ghwe IMNDEWA, unilole tanu, kuya ufikitse, kwaapfila nene nobetsighwa.”<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />“Mwemwe wabita nzila,” apfi achi si chinu chikulu baye kuna mwemwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">Mlole na mwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">Apfi kuna munu yana usungu ka nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">usungu aula IMNDEWA wayanighalile nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">ahala hayaghudubuke ng'ani?<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />Yeye kahulumsa ghumoto kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">nagho ghuhulumka mbaka ghulakatsa imipate yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">kanzatsa iiwapfu yanyonze ghamaghulu ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">kuya kambuyitsa kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">kandeka akuno nikangawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">na notsilika misi yose.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />Tsinzambi tsangu tsohighwa mna inila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">katsoha hamwe kwa ghumoko ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">natso tsipfika mbaka mna isingo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">Imulungu katsimalitsa tsingupfu tsangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">naye kandeka nighoghighwe na iwanu, awala nene sidaha baye kwitowa nawo.<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />Imndewa kawalema maasikali wangu wana tsingupfu wose iwonikinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">kawatuma maasikali wengi wanitsile, watse wawahonde honde iwasongolo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">Kawahonda iwanu wangu wa Yuda, ka apfila pfayohonda tsinzabibu hanu ha ukukamila idipfai.<verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />Achino chicho ichinitenda nene nilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">na tsinenge tsangu tsimema masotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">haduhu munu wowose iyali habehi wa ukunikanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">iyoghutenda ghumoyo ghwangu ghuhole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">iwanangu walekighwa yeka yeka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">kwaapfila iyonyihila kanihuma.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Iwanu wa Sayuni wogholosa ghamoko wapfilighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">lekeni kuduhu munu wa ukuwakanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Imulungu kawekila laghitso iwanu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">ka iwanu iwokala habehi hake wawehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">apfo ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghuwa chinu chihile kuna wawo.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />IMNDEWA katenda ighali gha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">kwaapfila nene tsandema ukukinda malaghitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Lelo nowadedetsa, mtegheletse mwemwe iwanu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">mlole apfila nene pfanighaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">wasongolo wangu na iwali wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">waghoghighwa waghenda kuna utumwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />Niwakema iwanikundile wanyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">lekeni wawo walemelesa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">Iwatambika wangu na sekulu tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">tsawafila mna ghumji hawang'ali wohemela ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">ili waje wakale wagima.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Ghwe Imndewa, lola apfila pfanighaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">mghati mwangu mwotama sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">na ghumoyo ghwangu ghuna usungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">kwaapfila nene tsanilema ukukinda malaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">ako kunze iwanu wokomighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">na ahano hakaye pfipfila iwanu wakufa.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />Iwanu wahulika pfanilila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">lekeni haduhu wa ukunikanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">maaduwi tsangu wose wahulika apfila pfanighanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">wawo wosekelela kwa alila lyautendile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Lelo leka litse litsuwa alila lyaulongile kutsowahigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">nawo wawe ka nene.<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />Na ghehile ghao ghoneke hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">uwatende ka pfaunitendele nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">haunihighile kwa kulola nzambi tsangu tsose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">Noghutilila aku nina usungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">na ghumoyo ghwangu ghwotsilika.<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="s">MNDEWA koghuhigha ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />IMNDEWA kaghonela maya ghumji ghwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">mbaka kawaghubika iwanu wake na ichisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">kakwasa hasi ukunogha kwa Isiraeli kulawa kulanga mbaka mna isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Hayawonele maya ng'ulu iwanu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">yeye ng'akumbuke baye ka ahano mna isi hana ing'anda yake.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />IMNDEWA katsihinya tsikaye tsose tsa iwanu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">wala ng'atsonele libatsi baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">aku kaghudubuka, tsakaimwagha imiji ya Yuda itsungulusighwe ubanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">kawatenda wafalume na iwakulu wake wone chinyala.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />Aku kaghudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">katsibena bena tsingupfu tsose tsa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">IMNDEWA ng'agholose ghumoko yawapfe baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">ahala hawetingane na maaduwi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">kawalakatsa iwanu wa Yakobu ka lambi lya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">ghumoto ililakatsa chila chinu ichili baho.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />Kapfedula minde yake ka aduwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">na ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo kaghwika ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">kawakoma iwanu wose wana tsingupfu watuwaghodele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">kawaghudubukila iwanu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">naye katughalila imaya yake ka moto ighulakatsa chila chinu.<verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />Imulungu kawa ka imunu iyotwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Kahinya isi yose ya Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">na mang'anda ghake ghose ghanoghile kaghabomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">kahinya imiji yose ina ubanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">na kongetsa usungu na chililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">kwa iwanu wa Yuda.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />Kaleka ing'anda yake ibomolighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">ka apfila chibanda chili mna ibustani pfachibomolighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">na kahinya hanu hake ha ukwitinganila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">IMNDEWA kawatenda iwanu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">wesemwe ghamatsuwa gha imitingano na tsisabato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">kawaleka iwafalume na iwatambika wabetsighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">kwaapfila tsakawonela maya ng'ulu.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />IMNDEWA kailema imatsabahu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">na kahaleka hanu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">kawaleka maaduwi waubomole ubanda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">iutsunguluke tsing'anda tsake tsa chifalume,,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">wakemelela mghati mwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">ka iwanu pfawokemelela ahala hawodeng'elela ichihungo.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />IMNDEWA tsakabama yaumwaghe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">ubanda utsunguluke ghumji ghwa Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">kagholosa lutsabi lwake yaghulinge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">na ng'oyitse kuchughu baye ghumoko ghwake yaleke kughuhinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">na iminala na ubanda mkulu utsunguluke ghumji tsaing'ali ilila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">kwaapfila pfose tsapfighwa hasi.<verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />Ghamalango gha Yerusalemu ghahasi mna ipfilundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">ghamachuma gha ukuhindila ghose kaghahinya na kaghabena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Wafalume na iwakulu wake waghalighwa kuna utumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">isi tsilihela wanu iwofunda ghamalaghisto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Manabii ng'awobokela keli baye ghamaono kulawa kwa INMDEWA.<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Iwanzehe wa ghumji gha Sayuni wakala hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">aku wenyamala tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">wemwaghila litimbwisi mna ghamatwi ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">na wapfala maghunila kulangusa usungu wali nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">na iwali wa Yerusalemu wenama mbaka pfihanga pfawo kulola hasi.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />Nenge tsangu tsipfa kwa ukulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Mghati mwangu mwotama ng'ani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">ghumoyo ghwangu ghwoghanzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">kwaapfila iwanu wangu wakomighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">na iwana wadowado na iwakong'a</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">wotsilika mna tsinzila tsa imiji.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Wowalilila mai tsao apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">“Chilikwani chijo na chokunwa,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">aku wotsilika ka wanu iwelaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">mna tsinzila tsa imiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">baho wakufa aku wakindighwa mna ghamoko gha mai tsao.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />Nikulongele choni ghwe Yerusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Angu ghweghwe nikulinge na choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Na wighala na nani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">ili nidahe kukukanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">ghwe Yerusalemu yunoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">chilonda chako chihimbika ka china cha ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">nani yodaha kukuhonetsa?<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />Manabii wako wakonela maono gha ughutsu na gha ubotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">wawo ng'awakulongele baye apfila pfauli na tsinzambi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">ili udahe kukomboka uleke kughenda kuna utumwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">Lekeni wawo wakwing'a ghamaono gha ughutsu ghendo na kukubugha.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />Wose iwobita mnzila wokubetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">wokwowela, ghweghwe Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">wohighitsa ghamatwi ghawo, akuno weghutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">“Angu aghuno ghughwo ghumji ighunoghile kubita imiji yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">ghumji ghudeng'elelighwa na iwanu wa tsiisi tsose?”<verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />Maaduwi tsako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">wakwasama imilomo yawo wokwowela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">wokufonza na wokugheghedela ghamatsino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">akuno wolonga, “Tughuhinya ghumji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">tubetetsa ukupfika kwa litsuwa alino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">na sambi lipfika na tulyona.”<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />IMNDEWA katenda aghala ghayabamile kutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">katenda alila lyayalongile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">katenda alila lyayalaghitse mna ghamatsuwa gha ghumwande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">Kaghughwisa hasi ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">naye ng'aghonele libatsi baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">kawaleka maaduwi wadeng'elele apfila pfaughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">naye kawongetsela tsingupfu maaduwi tsawo.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />Imimoyo ya iwanu yomlilila imndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">ghweghwe neghe Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">ghamasosi ghako ghalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">ka mto chilo na misi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">ulile na udomboketse bila kwipfa.<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Ulamke nechilo ulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">ghalonge ighali mna ghumoyo ghwako hambele ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">winule ghamoko ghako ulombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">walombele iwanagho iwotsilika kwa inzala mna tsinzila tsing'ulu.<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Lola, Ghwe IMNDEWA, na ufikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">angu nani yumtendele apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">wamapinga wawaje iwana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">iwana wao iwaweleke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Pfihi iwatambika na manabii wakomighwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">hanu hako helile Ghwe Imndewa?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Iwasongolo na iwanzehe iwafile wawasa mna tsinzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">iwali wangu na iwabwanga wangu wakomighwa kwa lipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">kuwakoma mna litsuwa lya imaya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">kuwakoma bila kuwonela libatsi.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />Kuwakema maaduwi tsangu kulawa chila hanu watse wanighele wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">kuwakema ka apfila wakutsa kuna ilusona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Ghweghwe IMNDEWA haughudubuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">tsakuduhu munu iyahepile wala iyahonile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">maaduwi tsangu wawakoma iwana wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">waniweleke na iyaniwalelile.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Kulawa kuna ukughagha mbaka kuna lilolelo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Nene na munu yambonile ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:1">kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakanitowa na ingweku ya imaya yake.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />Kaniwinga kutali na kanitenda nyange mna chisi chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:2">na si mna ghumwanga baye.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />Kagholosa ghendo ghumoko ghwake ghunitowe nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:3">naye kanifapula misi yose.<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />Kalutenda lukuli lwangu lulale na ingotsi yangu ilale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:4">na imipate yangu kaibena.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />Kanitowa na kanipfingila na kanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:5">apfo nina usungu na maghayo.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />Kanyika nikale mna chisi chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:6">ka iwanu wafile ghumwande.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />Kanitsengela ubanda unitsunguluke ndeke kulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:7">kanyoha kwa minyololo mikulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />Hata ning'alila na kukema yanyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:8">yeye kolema kunyidika.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />Yeye kadiwa nzila tsangu kwa mabwe makulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:9">na tsinzila tsangu katsaghisa ghendo.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />Yeye ka mnyama dubu iyonibeta yangoghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:10">kepfisa ka simba.<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />Kanibuluta kulawa mna inzila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:11">kanitsahula tsahula, na kandeka niliyeka.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />Kapfedula minde yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:12">na kanenda nene chinu cha kulengela.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />Kanihoma mmoyo kwa mishale yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:13">ilawile mna iyala yake.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />Nene niwa munu wa kusekighwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:14">na iwanu wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:14">misi yose wonibetsa kwa kunyimba nene.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />Kanimemetsa maghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:15">kanyongetsela usungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />Matsino ghangu ghabeneka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:16">kwa ukughegheda ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:16">kanikanyagha na kanibulughitsa mlipfu.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />Ukukala tseghamba kuka ghendo kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:17">na nisemwa ghendo ka ukubweda chinu chachi.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Apfo nilonga, “Tsingupfu tsangu tsimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:18">na chila chinu chandolele kulawa kwa IMNDEWA chuka.”<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />Noghakumbuka ghamaghayo ghangu, na ukwangakwanga kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:19">ako konitenda mbone usungu mkulu ka nyongo.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />Nene noghakumbuka agho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:20">na ghumoyo ghwangu ghotama ghendo.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Lekeni nina limwe lya ukukumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:21">na nene nina chinu cha ukulolela.<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />Ka uluso mkulu wa IMNDEWA kwa iwanu ng'aumalagha baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:22">na yeye ng'alekagha baye kuwonela iwanu libatsi.<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />Uluso wake na libatsi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:23">wakuwa wa sambi chila nemitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:23">yeye kotogholighwa ng'ani.<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />Nelongela mmoyo, “IMNDEWA yuyo yanimbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:24">Apfo nitsomlolela yeye.”<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />IMNDEWA kanogha kwa awala iwombeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:25">na kanogha kwa awala iwombama.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />Pfinogha imunu yabetetse ukombola kulawa kwa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:26">akuno kenyamala tulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />Pfinogha imunu yamanye ka kuna ukughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:27">kulawa mna matsuwa ghake gha usongolo.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />Yakale yaliyeka aku yenyamale tulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:28">ahala Imulungu hayomghalilia ghamaghayo.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />Leka yakale aku uhanga wake udonze mtimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:29">Songaha kuna lolelo ling'ali lyakutsa.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />Iyokutowa kanza limwe, mleke yakutowe kanza lingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:30">na utoghole kulighighwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA ng'atsomlema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:31">imunu baye matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />Yeye koghala usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:32">lekeni kana libatsi kwaapfila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:32">uluso wake mkulu ng'aumalaghala baye.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />Kwaapfila yeye ng'obama baye kuwadununza iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:33">wala kuwatenda wone usungu,<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />IMNDEWA komanya ahala iwanu wose iwohighwe iwali muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:34">hawobunzighwa na kuhondighwa,<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />na ghomba lya munu lyohighighwa pfihile hambele ha Imulungu,<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />na ghomba lya munu lyohighighwa pfihile hana libatsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:36">Agho ghose IMNDEWA ng'oghabama baye.<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />Nani iyolaghitsa ichinu nacho chotendeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:37">Apfi si Imulungu mwenyegho baye iyolaghitsa?<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Angu ghamaghayo na ighanoghile ng'agholawa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:38">kwa laghitso lya Imulungu yali kuchanya ng'ani?<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Heule lelo imunu yanung'unike ahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:39">hayotohighwa kwa tsinzambi tsake?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Lelo twikaghule na tulole pfatukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:40">na tumuyile IMNDEWA.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Leka tupfughule imimoyo yetu kwa Imulungu iyali kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:41">na twinule ghamoko ghetu, na tulombe apfino,<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />“Twetwe tutotsa na tukulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:42">na nzambi tsetu ng'utsilekelele baye.”<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />Tsakutuwinga aku kughudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:43">kutukoma bila kutwonela libatsi.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />Kwighubika ghumwenyegho mna libingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:44">ili chatulomba chileke kukupfikila.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />Kututenda twoneke mibangu na mipfulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:45">kwa iwanu wa isi tsingi.<verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />Iwotwihila wose wotwowela.<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />twoghanzika kwa ukupfuka na wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:47">kwaapfila tsatulekighwa yeka na kukomighwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />Ghamasotsi gholawa mna tsinenge tsangu ka pfikolongo pfa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:48">nolila kwaapfila iwanu wangu wakomighwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49" />Tsinenge tsangu ng'atsileka baye kulawa masotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:49">natso ng'atsikona ng'apfu baye,<verse eid="LAM 3:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50" />mbaka IMNDEWA kulawa kulanga yalole hasi na yone.<verse eid="LAM 3:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />Aghala ghanikona ghonighela usungu mna ghumoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:51">hanikona achila ichiwalawile iwapinga wose wa ghumji ghwangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />Awala iwonyihila hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:52">wanisaka ka chideghe.<verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />Wanyasa mpondo akuno namgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:53">na walundika ghamabwe mchanya mwangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />Ghamatsi tsaghanza kumema mbaka ghaghubika litwi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:54">baho nilonga, “Lelo nimala.”<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />Kulawa kuna lipondo alila ilighendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:55">nikulila ghweghwe IMNDEWA.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />Naghwe kuhulika chanikulombile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:56">“Uleke kudiwa maghutwi ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:56">uhulike hanikulomba unyapfile.”<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />Hanikukemile, ghweghwe kusoghela habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:57">kunilongela ndeke kupfuka.<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Ghweghwe IMNDEWA yunongelele ghomba lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:58">Kuukombola ugima wangu<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, kughona ghehile ghawanendedele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:59">lihighe ghoya ghomba lyangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />Kona apfila pfawonyihila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:60">na ghehile ghawabamile kunendela.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />Kuhulika maligho ghawoniligha ghwe IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:61">na ghehile ghawabamile kunendela.<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />Misi yose wao wenong'onetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:62">na wolonga mbuli tsa kunikoma nene.<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />Walole, hawokala na hawakwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:63">wawo wonyimbila wila tsa kunibetsa.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, Uwahighe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:64">kwa kulola aghala ghehile ghawatendile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:64">kwa kulola tsing'onde tsihile tsitendighwe na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:64">ghamoko ghawo.<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />Uwalighite kwa usughu iwali nawo.<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, uwawinzilitse akuno kowonela maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:66">uwakome wahupe ghendo ahano muisi.<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ukutimila kwa ukutowighwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Lola inzahabu pfailekile ukung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">nzahabu iyelile ghendo pfaipfinale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">mabwe gha samani gha ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">ghapwililika mna tsinzila tsose.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Lola iwana wa Sayuni pfawanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">wawo weghala ghendo na inzahabu yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">lekeni sambi wakoneka ka pfiya pfa udongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">pfifinighwe na ghamoko gha imunu.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Hata wambwa wa kubagho wowong'etsa iwana wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">lekeni iwamapinga iwali mna iwanu wangu wahela libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">weghala na mbuni iyokala kunyika.<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Milimi ya iwana wadowado yonanahila kuna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">kwaapfila wana ng'ilu ya ukong'a</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">iwana wolomba ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">lekeni kuduhu munu wa ukuweng'a.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Iwanu iwahondole pfijo pfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">sambi wotsilika mnzila kwa inzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">Iwanu iwalelelighwe na kupfala magwanda gha chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">sambi wowasa mna ghamalundo gha lipfu.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />Ghehile ghawatendile iwanu wangu makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:6">kubita inzambi ya iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:6">ghumji ighubidulighwe kwa kwidukitsa aku kuduhu munu iyenule ghumoko yaghwapfile.<verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />Iwakulu wake tsawedegheta kubita iseluji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">tsawatselu kubita matsiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">tsawadung'u kubita mabwe gha lubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">ipfihanga pfao tsapfighala na yakuti samawi.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Lekeni sambi ipfihanga pfawo pfiwa pfititu kubita lisitsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">hawobita mna tsinzila ng'awotangika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">ingotsi yawo inanahila mna imipate yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">na imipate yawo isakala, iwa ka ngodi.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Ng'apfu awala iwakomighwe kuna ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">kubita wawo iwafile kwa inzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">iwafile kwa ukughanzika lughalugha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">kwaapfila ng'awapatile ipfijo baye kulawa kumghunda.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />Iwamapinga iwakalagha na libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">kwa ghamoko ghawo iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">wawambika iwana wawo wenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">iwana wawo wawa chijo chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">ahala iwanu wangu hawakomighwe.<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />IMNDEWA kalangusa apfila pfayaghudubuke ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">kaighida imaya yake isoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">katuwa ghumoto ako Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">nagho ghulakatsa imisingi yake.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Wafalume wali mma isi ng'awatoghole baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">na iwanu iwokala muisi nawo ng'awatoghole baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">ka iyodununza iwanu na iaduwi kodaha kwingila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">mna ghamalango gha Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Tsailawila apfo kwaapfila manabii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">wa Yerusalemu tsawatenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">na iwatambika tsawatenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">apfo wawahonza iwanu walihela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">iwali mna ghumji agho wakomighwe.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Pfilongotsi awo wakwanga aku wobamasa bamasa mna tsinzila ka pfifita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">iwanu tsawapfuka ghendo ukuwakinda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">kwaapfila maghwanda ghawo ghafinala kwa idamu.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />Iwanu wawakemelela walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">“Ukeni, Ukeni, mleke kutukinda, mwemwe imfinale na ing'amtogholeka.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Apfo wanga wanga kulawa isi imwe mbaka isi ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">lekeni iwanu wa tsiisi atso wang'ali wawalonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">“Awano ng'awatsokala ahano baye.”<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />IMNDEWA imwenyegho kawapwililisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">wala ng'owafikitsa keli baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">kuduhu wa iyawahuliktse iwatambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">wala iyawonele libatsi pfilongotsi.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Tsinenge tsetu tsipfa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">ukulolela hela twapfilighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">tsatwima kuna iminala yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">ukulolela isi ing'aidaha baye ukutwapfila.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Iwanu wawinzilitsa ghamatsayo ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">ng'atudahile baye kubita mna tsinzila tsetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">twetwe tsatwahabehi na ukuhupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">na matsuwa ghetu ghamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">kwaapfila ukutsigha kwetu kupfika.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Iwatuwinzilitse tsa wabewe kubita pfitema iwali mlanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">watuwinga mna ipfidunda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">na watupfitsila ako kunyika.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />Imfalume iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">ayula iyakindile ugima wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">konzeka mna imitegho yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">ayula yatulongile, “Yeye katsotukinga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">hatutsokala mna isi tsa wanu wangi.”<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />Mdeng'elele na msekelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">mwemwe iwanu wa Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">mwemwe imkala isi ya Usi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">lekeni chikombe achino ichimemile imaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">chitsowatsila, namwe mtsochinwela na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">mtsopatika na mtsokona chinyala.<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Ghwe ghumji ghwa Sayuni ukughaya kwako kutsomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">ng'atsakongetsa baye ghamatsuwa gha ukukala kuna isi ya utumwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Naye katsowahigha mwemwe Waedomu kwa ghehile ghenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">na tsinzambi tsenu katsotsika mwatsi baye.<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlomba libatsi IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, ukumbuke ighatulawile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:1">Ulole, na wone pfatughelighwa chinyala.<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Isi yetu weng'ighwa iwagheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">na tsing'anda tsetu wokala iwanu wa isi tsingi.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Twetwe twa wachuwa, twahela aba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:3">mai tsetu wawa ka pfitsuka.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Toghula ghamatsi gha ukunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">na tsingondi natso twoghula.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Awala iwotuwinga sambi wahachisogho hetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:5">twipfa lekeni ng'owotuleka tubwihile baye.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Tugholosa ghamoko kuwalomba Wamisiri na Waashuru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:6">tupate chijo cha ukwighuta.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Iwahenga wetu tsawatenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">na sambi ng'awalibaha keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">na twetwe twoghaya kwa ighehile ghawo.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Iwatumwa wawo iwotulongotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:8">na kuduhu wa kutukombola mna ghamoko ghawo.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Twopata ichijo kwa kwaghitsa ugima wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:9">kwaapfila iwokoma iwanu wepfisa mna imighunda.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Ngotsi yetu yolakatsa ka tanulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:10">kwaapfila inzala yotuluma.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Mapinga tsetu woghoghiwa kwa ngupfu na iwamale ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:11">na iwali wetu nawo woghoghiwa kwa ngupfu na iwamale mna imiji ya Yuda.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />Pfilongotsi wetu wakondekighwa kwa ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:12">na iwanzehe wetu ng'awohulikitsighwa baye.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Wowanahitsa iwabwanga wetu wasaghe kwa ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:13">iwasongolo wotsenzeuka na imitsigho ya tsingodi.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Wanzehe wetu waleka kughenda hana lilango lya ghumji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:14">iwasongolo wetu waleka ukwimba na ukutowa tsingoma.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Imimoyo yetu ng'aideng'elela keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:15">sambi ng'atubigha baye ila twodomboketsa.<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Mfalume yatung'ali tweghodela sambi ng'alibaho baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:16">lelo tutsochona kwaapfila tutenda nzambi.<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Kwa agha ghatutendile imimoyo yetu itenyuka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:17">na tsinenge tsetu ng'atsilola ghoya baye.<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />Kwaapfila kuchidunda cha Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:18">kulekighwa yeka yeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:18">ako wambweha wakwanga kwanga.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Lekeni Ghweghwe IMNDEWA yutawala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">ufalume wako wokala kulawa lweleko lumwe mbaka lweleko lungi.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Heule utusemwile kwa matsuwa ghose aghano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:20">Heule utulekile kwa matsuwa aghano mengi?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21" />Utuyitse kuna ghweghwe ghumwenyegho, Ghwe IIMNDEWA, na twetwe tutsokuyila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:21">ghatende matsuwa ghetu ghanoghe, ghawe ka gha ghumwande.<verse eid="LAM 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22" />Angu ghweghwe kutulema ghendo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:22">Apfi kutughudubukila ng'ani?<verse eid="LAM 5:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>